				 Getting Started 

 What is Origins TCG? 
Origins TCG is a competitive and highly collectable card game built for fast, tactical matches. Collect, trade, and battle with cards inspired by myths, legends, and fairy tales from around the world.

 Is Origins TCG free to play? 
Yes. We style Origins TCG as a 'free-to-compete' game, meaning the base version of every card is free. You'll never need to pay to gain a competitive advantage. Paid packs exist purely for cosmetic, collectible alternat...			&lt;/div&gt;
